      'Initial deal: each active player receives 3 private face-down cards after boot is collected.',
      'Prial of Threes: 3_spades, 3_hearts, and 3_clubs form the strongest traditional Brag hand.',
      'Running Flush: A_spades, K_spades, and Q_spades are consecutive cards in one suit and beat an ordinary run, flush, pair, or high card.',
